Jude Shin

Notes for Grading: All steps of this project were completed.

Reflections: The scene is supposed to be Yosemite, CA surrounding a flower that
opens and closes it's petals. I grew up going to Yosemite for vacation, and I 
love nature and the outdoors. The flower mesh that was provided for this 
project was the multi-shaped one. The mountain (Half Dome) in the background is 
just one large static mesh. When I was looking around, there were a lot of 
meshes for video games, and meshes for applications that may need to display 
some geographic data (like Yosemite valley). I also saw a lot of STL files that 
are used for 3D printing, but there were converters online that could change it 
from one format to the other. 

